        // GHSA-v2v4-37r5-5v8g / GHSA-mwp4-54f8-5fhr / GHSA-rpw4-54j3-4h4q /
        // GHSA-j6r3-76f7-8jcv / GHSA-h3mg-xc3c-68pw (ip-address):
        // geoip-country@5.x requires ip-address@^6.4.0; ip-address 6.4.0 is the
        // latest 6.x release (no patch exists in the 6.x line). A cross-major
        // override to 10.x would break geoip-country's API surface. Our SSRF
        // protection is handled by ipaddr.js, not ip-address, so the isLinkLocal()
        // inaccuracy in ip-address is not reachable through security-sensitive paths.
        // Do not override across majors without compatibility approval.
        // Owner: team-engineering-reviewers. Tracking: create internal ticket.
        // Expires: 2026-12-29.
